49:
  title: AROUSAL!
  lines:
    - if: d.who_am_i === 0
      lines:
        - By sheer chance, %YOU% discovered %CHARA%'s true identity as %UMA% %CHARA_ACTUAL%.
        - Looking utterly defeated, %CHARA% asked %YOU% to keep %SEX% secret.
    - The relationship between %YOU% and %CHARA% took a dramatic turn...
    - With a snap, %CHARA% opened her folding fan to hide a wandering gaze...

